    "q": "<figure class=\"aa-source workshop-facsimile\"><img class=\"source-facsimile\" src=\"assets/arp-workshop-additions/ws-source-069.png\" width=\"1728\" height=\"261\" alt=\"Define the following terms:\n•Grant date\n•Vest date\n•Vesting period\" loading=\"eager\"></figure>",
    "a": "<figure class=\"aa-source workshop-facsimile\"><img class=\"source-facsimile\" src=\"assets/arp-workshop-additions/ws-source-070.png\" width=\"1728\" height=\"229\" alt=\"• Grant Date: The date on which the entity and counterparty (e.g. supplier or employee) agree to a \nshare-based payment arrangement.\n• Vesting Date: The date on which the counterparty is entitled to receive the equity instruments \ngranted.\n• Vesting Period: The period between grant date and vesting date.\" loading=\"eager\"></figure>",
