    "provider": "ICAS",
    "q": "<figure class=\"aa-source workshop-facsimile\"><img class=\"source-facsimile\" src=\"assets/arp-workshop-additions/ws-source-071.png\" width=\"1728\" height=\"972\" alt=\"Equity-settled Shared-based payments\n• What are they used for?\n• How are they measured\n• When and how are they recognised\n• How do the following terms apply:\n• Grant date\n• Vest date\n• Vesting period\n• Conditions?\n• What happens at subsequent reporting dates\n \nICAS ARP Workshop 3\n45\" loading=\"eager\"></figure>",
    "a": "<figure class=\"aa-source workshop-facsimile\"><img class=\"source-facsimile\" src=\"assets/arp-workshop-additions/ws-source-072.png\" width=\"1728\" height=\"972\" alt=\"Equity-Settled Share-Based Payments\n•\nAn equity instrument where equity shares are granted to employees or suppliers as payment \nfor goods /services / performance\n•\nRecognise when goods or services are received (usually suppliers) or over a period of time\n•\nMeasured at FV on receipt of the goods or services if measurable or FV of the equity \ninstrument on grant date\n•\nTo Suppliers – usually recognise immediately\n•\nDR Supplier Expense or PPE Asset / CR Share Capital and CR Share Premium\n•\nTo Employees – over time as usually dependent on vesting conditions including:\n•\nPeriod of service – recognise over the vesting period and update at each reporting \nperiod on expectation\n•\nPerformance related to share price – no adjustment is made at each reporting period\n•\nPerformance not related to share price, eg revenue increase or performance targets \n– update at each reporting period based on expectation\n•\nDR Staff Costs / CR Retained Earnings\nICAS ARP Workshop 3\n46\" loading=\"eager\"></figure><figure class=\"aa-source workshop-facsimile\"><img class=\"source-facsimile\" src=\"assets/arp-workshop-additions/ws-source-073.png\" width=\"1728\" height=\"972\" alt=\"Equity-Settled Share-Based Payments\n•\nAt vest date options are exercised or lapse \n•\nExercised – recognise \nDR Bank / CR Share Capital and Share Premium\n•\nLapsed – No accounting required\n•\nFor either exercised or lapsed, can transfer from Retained Earnings to another reserve \nwithin Equity \nICAS ARP Workshop 3\n47\" loading=\"eager\"></figure>",
    "searchText": "Equity-settled Shared-based payments\n• What are they used for?\n• How are they measured\n• When and how are they recognised\n• How do the following terms apply:\n• Grant date\n• Vest date\n• Vesting period\n• Conditions?\n• What happens at subsequent reporting dates\n \nICAS ARP Workshop 3\n45",
